<title>THAILAND: Thailand asks banks to help finance firms.</title>
<headline>Thailand asks banks to help finance firms.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's central bank has asked commercial banks to avoid recalling oustanding loans granted to small finance firms which have come under pressure from market talk that they may be in trouble, the BOT spokeswoman said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
